<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Universal_Store> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Universal Store** (also known as \"**Universal**\") is an Australian [fashion](:Fashion) retailer operating across ACT, NSW, TAS, VIC, QLD, SA, NT and WA that sells both international and national brands. The retailer specialises in [streetwear](:Streetwear), denim, skate clothing and surfwear.Universal Store stocks brands such as [Champion](:Champion_%28sportswear%29), Perfect Stranger, Tommy Jeans, Kiss Chacey, Thrills, and Barney Cools, as well as [Denim](:Denim) brands such as Abrand Jeans, Nobody Denim, [Wrangler](:Wrangler_%28jeans%29) and [Lee](:Lee_%28jeans%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
