<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Project_Blogger> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Project Blogger is an educational initiative in Ireland by Discover Science & Engineering (DSE). It provides blogging tools and an online space for secondary school students and their teachers to create blogs about their school science experiments and science interests. Through the blogs, the students can share their experiences about science with their classmates, as well as with students from other schools across Ireland. The scheme was piloted in the 2007–08 academic year and was extended the following year."@en .
