<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Chief_creative_officer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A chief creative officer (CCO) is the highest ranking position of the creative team within a company. Depending on the type of company, this position may be responsible for the overall look and feel of marketing, media, and branding associated with the organization. The CCO may also be charged with managing, developing, and leading the team of creative directors, art directors, designers, and copywriters."@en .
