<http://dbpedia.org/resource/TracFone_Wireless> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "TracFone Wireless, Inc. (TFWI) is an American prepaid, no-contract mobile phone provider. TFWI is a subsidiary of Verizon Communications, and offers products and services under several brands. It operates as a mobile virtual network operator (MVNO), holding agreements with the three largest United States wireless network operators to provide service: AT&T Mobility, T-Mobile US, and Verizon."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Warrenville,_Illinois> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Warrenville is a near west suburb in DuPage County, Illinois, United States. At the 2010 census, the city had a total population of 13,140, which was estimated to have increased to 13,174 by July 2019. It is a part of the Chicago metropolitan area and the Illinois Technology and Research Corridor."@en .
