<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Juba_International_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Juba Airport (IATA: JUB, ICAO: HJJJ) is an airport serving Juba, the capital city of South Sudan. The airport is located 5 km (3 mi) northeast of the city's central business district, on the western banks of the White Nile. The city and airport are located in South Sudan's Central Equatoria State."@en .
