<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Earl_Shilton_Building_Society> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Earl Shilton Building Society is a UK building society, which has its head office in Earl Shilton, Leicestershire. It is the 53rd largest in the United Kingdom based on total assets of £96.1 million as at 31 March 2008. It is a member of the Building Societies Association."@en .
