<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Small_and_medium-sized_enterprises> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) or small and medium-sized businesses (SMBs) are businesses whose personnel and revenue numbers fall below certain limits. The abbreviation \"SME\" is used by international organizations such as the World Bank, the European Union, the United Nations, and the World Trade Organization (WTO)."@en .
