<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hans_Vestberg> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Hans Vestberg** (born 23 June 1965) is a Swedish businessman and CEO of [Verizon Communications](:Verizon_Communications), where he has worked as executive vice president of the company's network and technology team, and as chief technology officer. Vestberg was previously the CEO of telecommunications company [Ericsson](:Ericsson), president of the [Swedish Olympic Committee](:Swedish_Olympic_Committee), and chairman of the [Swedish Handball Federation](:Swedish_Handball_Federation)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
