<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Krohn_Air> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Krohn Air AS was a virtual, regional airline whose primary route was between Molde Airport, Årø to Trondheim Airport, Værnes in Norway. The airline was established in 2010 after Scandinavian Airlines pulled out of the Molde–Trondheim route. The airline aimed at the business segment, with early morning departures and two daily round trips."@en .
