<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Statesville,_North_Carolina> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Statesville is a city in and the county seat of Iredell County, North Carolina, United States, and it is part of the Charlotte metropolitan area. Statesville was established in 1789 by an act of the North Carolina Legislature. The population was recorded as 95 in the 1800 Census. The population was 28,419 at the time of the 2020 census."@en .
