<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Universal_Store> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Universal Store (also known as \"Universal\") is an Australian fashion retailer operating across ACT, NSW, TAS, VIC, QLD, SA, NT and WA that sells both international and national brands. The retailer specialises in streetwear, denim, skate clothing and surfwear. Universal Store stocks brands such as Champion, Perfect Stranger, Tommy Jeans, Kiss Chacey, Thrills, and , as well as Denim brands such as Abrand Jeans, Nobody Denim, Wrangler and Lee."@en .
