<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Khartoum_International_Airport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Khartoum International Airport (IATA: KRT, ICAO: HSSK) (Arabic:مطار الخرطوم الدولي) is the principal airport in Khartoum, the capital of Sudan. Khartoum airport is situated in the heart of the capital and serves as the country's main gateway to the world. A list of Royal Air Force units and organisations that operated from the site from the 1920s can be seen here."@en .
