<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Annapolis,_Maryland> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Annapolis (/əˈnæpəlɪs/ ə-NAP-ə-lis) is the capital city of the U.S. state of Maryland as well as the county seat of, and only incorporated city in, Anne Arundel County. Situated on the Chesapeake Bay at the mouth of the Severn River, 25 miles (40 km) south of Baltimore and about 30 miles (50 km) east of Washington, D.C., Annapolis forms part of the Baltimore–Washington metropolitan area. The 2020 census recorded its population as 40,812, an increase of 6.3% since 2010."@en .
