<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Old_Navy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Old Navy** is an American clothing and accessories retailing company owned by [multinational corporation](:Multinational_corporation) [Gap Inc.](:Gap_Inc%2E) It has corporate operations in the [Mission Bay](:Mission_Bay%2C_San_Francisco) neighborhood of [San Francisco](:San_Francisco), [California](:California). The largest of the Old Navy stores are its flagship stores, located in [New York City](:New_York_City), [Seattle](:Seattle), [Chicago](:Chicago), [San Francisco](:San_Francisco), [Manila](:Manila), and [Mexico City](:Mexico_City)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
