<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Xi'an> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Xi'an (UK: /ʃiːˈæn/ shee-AN, US: /ʃiːˈɑːn/ shee-AHN; Chinese: 西安; pinyin: Xī'ān; Chinese: [ɕí.án]), frequently spelled as Xian and also known by , is the capital of Shaanxi Province. A sub-provincial city on the Guanzhong Plain, the city is the third most populous city in Western China, after Chongqing and Chengdu, as well as the most populous city in Northwest China. Its total population was 12,952,907 as of the 2020 census. The total urban population was 9.28 million."@en .
