<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Square_Enix_Europe> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Square Enix Limited (formerly Domark Limited and Eidos Interactive Limited) is a British subsidiary of Japanese video game company Square Enix, acting as their European publishing arm. The company formerly owned Tomb Raider, which was in development under CentreGold in 1996, and had acquired Crystal Dynamics in 1998, among numerous other assets, until 2022. Square Enix Limited and fellow group company Square Enix Incorporated shared \"Phil\" Rogers as CEO and other executives from 2013 to 2022."@en .
