<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Trip_hop> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Trip hop (sometimes used synonymously with \"downtempo\") is a musical genre that originated in the early 1990s in the United Kingdom, especially Bristol. It has been described as a psychedelic fusion of hip hop and electronica with slow tempos and an atmospheric sound, often incorporating elements of jazz, soul, funk, reggae, dub, R&B, and other forms of electronic music, as well as sampling from movie soundtracks and other eclectic sources."@en .
