<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Antwerp> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Antwerp (/ˈæntwɜːrp/; Dutch: Antwerpen [ˈɑntʋɛrpə(n)]; French: Anvers [ɑ̃vɛʁs]) is the largest city in Belgium by area at 204.51 square kilometres (78.96 sq mi) and the capital of Antwerp Province in the Flemish Region. With a population of 520,504, it is the most populous city center in Belgium, and with a metropolitan population of around 1,200,000 people, it is the second-largest metropolitan region after Brussels."@en .
