<http://dbpedia.org/resource/The_Grand_Tour_Game> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Grand Tour Game is an episodic racing video game developed and published Amazon Game Studios with additional support being provided by Heavy Iron Studios. The title was released for the PlayStation 4 and Xbox One. It is based on the Amazon Prime series The Grand Tour. It covers the first episode of Series 1 and Series 2 and released a new episode of the game simultaneously with each episode of Series 3. This is Amazon's first video game for the two consoles."@en .
