<http://dbpedia.org/resource/St._Julian's,_Malta> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Saint Julian's (Maltese: San Ġiljan) is a town in the Central Region of Malta. As of 2020, its registered number of inhabitants stands at 13,792. It is situated along the coast, north of the country's capital, Valletta. It is known for tourism-oriented businesses, such as hotels, restaurants and nightclubs which are centred mainly in an area known as Paceville."@en .
