<http://dbpedia.org/resource/SoundHound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**SoundHound Inc.** is an [audio](:Search_by_sound) and [speech recognition](:Speech_recognition) company founded in 2005. It develops speech recognition, [natural language understanding](:Natural_language_understanding), sound recognition and search technologies. Its featured products include Houndify, a Voice AI developer platform, Hound, a voice-enabled digital assistant, and [music recognition](:Music_recognition) mobile app SoundHound. The company’s headquarters are in [Santa Clara](:Santa_Clara%2C_California), [California](:California)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
