<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Abner-Drury_Brewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Abner-Drury Brewery, operating from 1898 to 1938, was a brewery in the Foggy Bottom neighborhood of Washington, D.C. The brewery went into bankruptcy on July 31, 1935, and was subsequently reorganized as Washington Brewery, Inc. It went out of business permanently in August 1938."@en .
