<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Candy_Crush_Saga> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Candy Crush Saga is a free-to-play tile-matching video game released by King on April 12, 2012, originally for Facebook; other versions for iOS, Android, Windows Phone, and Windows 10 followed. It is a variation of their browser game Candy Crush. King has since released three related titles, Candy Crush Soda Saga, Candy Crush Jelly Saga and Candy Crush Friends Saga, and most of the company's other mobile titles follow the same Saga freemium format."@en .
