<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Molde> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Molde (Norwegian pronunciation: [ˈmɔ̂ɫdə]) is a town and municipality in Møre og Romsdal county, Norway. It is located in the traditional district of Romsdal. It is located on the Romsdal Peninsula, surrounding the Fannefjord and Moldefjord. Molde has a maritime, temperate climate, with cool-to-warm summers, and relatively mild winters. The city is nicknamed The City of Roses."@en .
