<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Naver_Corporation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Naver Corporation is a South Korean internet conglomerate headquartered in Seongnam that operates the search engine Naver. Naver established itself as an early pioneer in the use of user-generated content through the creation of the online Q&A platform Knowledge iN. Naver also manages global mobile services such as the mobile messenger LINE, video messenger SNOW, and group communication service BAND."@en .
